sequenceDiagram
    participant OD as OutboxDispatcher
    participant Bus as event.Bus
    participant CW as ContainerCreateWorker
    participant RT as Runtime(Docker/K8s)
    participant CM as ContainerManager

    OD->>Bus: OutboxCreateRequestEvent
    Bus->>CW: Handle(OutboxCreateRequestEvent)
    CW->>CW: 获取信号量 (阻塞)
    CW->>CM: executeCreate (rt.Create + rt.Start)
    CM->>RT: Create + Start
    CM-->>CW: 返回成功 (status=Creating)
    CW->>CW: tracking.Store(instanceID, doneCh)
    CW->>CW: select { doneCh / timeout }
    
    Note over CW: 信号量仍被持有...

    RT-->>CM: ContainerStarted 事件
    CM->>CM: transition → Running
    CM->>CM: 写 OutboxEvent
    OD->>OD: 轮询 → 发布 ContainerEvent
    Bus->>CW: Handle(ContainerEvent)
    CW->>CW: tracking.Load → close(doneCh)
    
    CW->>CW: <-doneCh 解除阻塞
    CW->>CW: MarkOutboxEventSent
    CW->>CW: 释放信号量